(7350190, 1149778, 180170, '<td valign="top">10! the eyes are amazing, colors work well together. fab dof. great pose.<br/>my favorite one of the challenge :)</td>', '10! the eyes are amazing, colors work well together. fab dof. great pose.my favorite one of the challenge :)', '2015-05-13 03:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350191, 1149453, 180170, '<td valign="top">10!  my second favorite of the challenge :)</td>', '10!  my second favorite of the challenge :)', '2015-05-13 03:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350192, 1149759, 180170, '<td valign="top">my third favorite for the challenge :)</td>', 'my third favorite for the challenge :)', '2015-05-13 03:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350195, 1149733, 135744, '<td valign="top">Well done on winning the blue</td>', 'Well done on winning the blue', '2015-05-13 04:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350207, 1149731, 159723, '<td valign="top">The noise effect is not working for me in this particular image, but I like that you have tried something different. Also, what a great smile!</td>', 'The noise effect is not working for me in this particular image, but I like that you have tried something different. Also, what a great smile!', '2015-05-13 07:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350208, 1149636, 159723, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white. I don''t necessarily need eye contact with the subject in a portrait, but I would have preferred to see more of his face</td>', 'Love the black and white. I don''t necessarily need eye contact with the subject in a portrait, but I would have preferred to see more of his face', '2015-05-13 07:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350209, 1149595, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful! Would love to see what it looks like in b&amp;w or desaturated. Not that I think it would necessarily be better. Just curious :)</td>', 'I think this is wonderful! Would love to see what it looks like in b&w or desaturated. Not that I think it would necessarily be better. Just curious :)', '2015-05-13 07:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350211, 1149766, 159723, '<td valign="top">To me the white in her eye is a little bit too white, but interesting image. Nice b&amp;w</td>', 'To me the white in her eye is a little bit too white, but interesting image. Nice b&w', '2015-05-13 07:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350212, 1149778, 159723, '<td valign="top">Its a bit hard to see that the headwear is a sixpence, but besides that I think this is a wonderful portrait. Nice colours, not too much processing and lovely expression in his face.</td>', 'Its a bit hard to see that the headwear is a sixpence, but besides that I think this is a wonderful portrait. Nice colours, not too much processing and lovely expression in his face.', '2015-05-13 07:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350213, 1149583, 159723, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous girl! I think maybe getting her to lift her chin up just a little might have improved the shot.</td>', 'Gorgeous girl! I think maybe getting her to lift her chin up just a little might have improved the shot.', '2015-05-13 07:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350214, 1149717, 159723, '<td valign="top">I would prefer it if both eyes where in focus, but nice shot!</td>', 'I would prefer it if both eyes where in focus, but nice shot!', '2015-05-13 07:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350215, 1149751, 159723, '<td valign="top">Stunning girl and great image! Is her left hand (the one with the ring) a little bit soft compared to the rest? Regardless, its a 9 from me!</td>', 'Stunning girl and great image! Is her left hand (the one with the ring) a little bit soft compared to the rest? Regardless, its a 9 from me!', '2015-05-13 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350220, 1149770, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great shot and crop, however I''m not sure about the processing. I get the feeling that she is not quite as old as this portrait makes her look like. But I''m not sure so I will refrain from giving you a score. Sorry, probably not very helpful.</td>', 'Great shot and crop, however I''m not sure about the processing. I get the feeling that she is not quite as old as this portrait makes her look like. But I''m not sure so I will refrain from giving you a score. Sorry, probably not very helpful.', '2015-05-13 08:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350223, 1149537, 159723, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, but I have to say this. It is probably really silly of me, but I''ll mention it because maybe other people feel the same way. I''m really not trying to be an ass. Maybe I should ask other people in the forum what they think. Anyway...I know it should not matter, but when I see a good image like this one and then notice, what I assume is the image number, in the title I almost (and I emphasise almost) want to give it a lower score than what I intended. It''s a great image and I thin it deserves a better title, even if it is "just" Rita. :)</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, but I have to say this. It is probably really silly of me, but I''ll mention it because maybe other people feel the same way. I''m really not trying to be an ass. Maybe I should ask other people in the forum what they think. Anyway...I know it should not matter, but when I see a good image like this one and then notice, what I assume is the image number, in the title I almost (and I emphasise almost) want to give it a lower score than what I intended. It''s a great image and I thin it deserves a better title, even if it is "just" Rita. :)', '2015-05-13 08:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350225, 1149584, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think this is an awesome portrait, but the facial paint is not doing it for me. Her wonderful statuesque manner is great though!</td>', 'I think this is an awesome portrait, but the facial paint is not doing it for me. Her wonderful statuesque manner is great though!', '2015-05-13 08:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350226, 1149515, 159723, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot and crop. The girls is beautiful and her hair and gaze is awesome. I probably would have given you a 10 had it not been for the excessive (in my eyes) retouching of her skin.<br/> <br/>Update: what size screen or image size (or what ever it is called) are you working on when you do your process? I just had another look at your image on my macbook, as oppose to the first look which was on my 27'''' iMac. The amount of retouching is not nearly as visible on the small macbook screen. I just thought i''d let you know in case other people make similar comments. Perhaps they review the images on bigger screens as well?</td>', 'Fabulous shot and crop. The girls is beautiful and her hair and gaze is awesome. I probably would have given you a 10 had it not been for the excessive (in my eyes) retouching of her skin. Update: what size screen or image size (or what ever it is called) are you working on when you do your process? I just had another look at your image on my macbook, as oppose to the first look which was on my 27'''' iMac. The amount of retouching is not nearly as visible on the small macbook screen. I just thought i''d let you know in case other people make similar comments. Perhaps they review the images on bigger screens as well?', '2015-05-13 08:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350228, 1149572, 159723, '<td valign="top">Love it! I only gave two 10s in this challenge and you are one of them</td>', 'Love it! I only gave two 10s in this challenge and you are one of them', '2015-05-13 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350239, 1149592, 10785, '<td valign="top">A luvely mum! The background really makes me dizzy here. I think the saturated colors and contrast in the background draws me right past the subject, who appears to have less contrast and is more neutral in color. Perhaps centering the subject would have caused the background to frame the subject leading to a better composition.</td>', 'A luvely mum! The background really makes me dizzy here. I think the saturated colors and contrast in the background draws me right past the subject, who appears to have less contrast and is more neutral in color. Perhaps centering the subject would have caused the background to frame the subject leading to a better composition.', '2015-05-13 10:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350240, 1149583, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good technicals on this. The model appears to be on guard here. Perhaps she is an introvert which if that is so, then you captured her personality well. However some emotion would help the viewer build a connection to the image.</td>', 'Very good technicals on this. The model appears to be on guard here. Perhaps she is an introvert which if that is so, then you captured her personality well. However some emotion would help the viewer build a connection to the image.', '2015-05-13 10:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350241, 1149515, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. The only thing I would change is to frame this in a 3:4 or a 4:5 format rather than a 2:3 format. It appears tall and thin for a portrait and there is more of her to see that is not shown.</td>', 'Wonderful. The only thing I would change is to frame this in a 3:4 or a 4:5 format rather than a 2:3 format. It appears tall and thin for a portrait and there is more of her to see that is not shown.', '2015-05-13 10:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
