(7350285, 1149759, 159723, '<td valign="top">Cool image, not sure how it will score considering you don''t see her face. Is she laying on the floor holing herself up with one shoulder? If so, then I hope for the model''s sake that you did not have to do many shots. Holding your body up like that is hard :)</td>', 'Cool image, not sure how it will score considering you don''t see her face. Is she laying on the floor holing herself up with one shoulder? If so, then I hope for the model''s sake that you did not have to do many shots. Holding your body up like that is hard :)', '2015-05-13 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350292, 1149759, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very well executed. Logically, it only makes sense that she''s laying on her side, but it makes you think at first. For those not used to dissecting how images are created, they might think you''re magic!</td>', 'Very well executed. Logically, it only makes sense that she''s laying on her side, but it makes you think at first. For those not used to dissecting how images are created, they might think you''re magic!', '2015-05-13 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350293, 1149585, 60173, '<td valign="top">This would be a funny "Hang in there" poster, like that cat hanging from the tree limb.</td>', 'This would be a funny "Hang in there" poster, like that cat hanging from the tree limb.', '2015-05-13 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350295, 1149490, 60173, '<td valign="top">I might also ask, "Why so close to the wall?" and "Why such harsh light?" I''m sure it''s all intentional, but it''s not a style I particularly care for.</td>', 'I might also ask, "Why so close to the wall?" and "Why such harsh light?" I''m sure it''s all intentional, but it''s not a style I particularly care for.', '2015-05-13 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350296, 1149749, 60173, '<td valign="top">lol so intense.</td>', 'lol so intense.', '2015-05-13 14:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350297, 1149618, 60173, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the processing of this at all. There''s a lot of missing pixel information.</td>', 'Don''t like the processing of this at all. There''s a lot of missing pixel information.', '2015-05-13 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350298, 1149524, 60173, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be a little too far back. I would expect the foreground hair to be the focus, but it seems that the most in-focus portion is at the top of her head. Also, the background has a touch of pink, and I would expect white.</td>', 'The focus seems to be a little too far back. I would expect the foreground hair to be the focus, but it seems that the most in-focus portion is at the top of her head. Also, the background has a touch of pink, and I would expect white.', '2015-05-13 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350300, 1149758, 60173, '<td valign="top">A square crop would have helped this image fit the challenge better. I see some arms there, and I believe the intent of the challenge was to not show much below the shoulders.</td>', 'A square crop would have helped this image fit the challenge better. I see some arms there, and I believe the intent of the challenge was to not show much below the shoulders.', '2015-05-13 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350301, 1149648, 60173, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait, but maybe a little too tight for the challenge? I''d like to see a bit more shoulder.</td>', 'A lovely portrait, but maybe a little too tight for the challenge? I''d like to see a bit more shoulder.', '2015-05-13 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350302, 1149768, 60173, '<td valign="top">In the Advanced Editing rule set, you could have legally cloned out that line on the right side of the image.</td>', 'In the Advanced Editing rule set, you could have legally cloned out that line on the right side of the image.', '2015-05-13 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350306, 1149777, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the pose and that FABULOUS hair!<br/> <br/>I''m not fond of the overly smoothed skin and over-cooked eyes.</td>', 'I love the pose and that FABULOUS hair! I''m not fond of the overly smoothed skin and over-cooked eyes.', '2015-05-13 14:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350307, 1149666, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh here, wish there was a bit more light on his face, though.</td>', 'I like the bokeh here, wish there was a bit more light on his face, though.', '2015-05-13 14:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350309, 1149734, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like this.. great job on the eyes.  Love the hues and tones.</td>', 'I like this.. great job on the eyes.  Love the hues and tones.', '2015-05-13 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350310, 1149753, 35086, '<td valign="top">Probably my favourite, or at least top three.  Very soft skin but it works well here.  and that red, bang!</td>', 'Probably my favourite, or at least top three.  Very soft skin but it works well here.  and that red, bang!', '2015-05-13 14:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350311, 1149648, 35086, '<td valign="top">Powerful portrait.  Good job.</td>', 'Powerful portrait.  Good job.', '2015-05-13 15:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350312, 1149592, 35086, '<td valign="top">The bokeh creates a pretty cool effect, I like it.</td>', 'The bokeh creates a pretty cool effect, I like it.', '2015-05-13 15:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350313, 1149717, 35086, '<td valign="top">Now that''s character.  Love the details.  Good shot.</td>', 'Now that''s character.  Love the details.  Good shot.', '2015-05-13 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350314, 1149758, 35086, '<td valign="top">Points for making me smile! haha.  Good stuff. :)</td>', 'Points for making me smile! haha.  Good stuff. :)', '2015-05-13 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350318, 1149605, 96751, '<td valign="top">Freaky</td>', 'Freaky', '2015-05-13 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350319, 1149739, 96751, '<td valign="top">A lovely lady. But using global sharpening this way really brings out harsh textures in the skin, and creates artifacts in the eyes</td>', 'A lovely lady. But using global sharpening this way really brings out harsh textures in the skin, and creates artifacts in the eyes', '2015-05-13 15:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350320, 1149506, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet, waaaaay too sharpened</td>', 'Sweet, waaaaay too sharpened', '2015-05-13 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350321, 1149666, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. Very cute. It may be me, but I think the focus is mid head and the face is a bit soft.</td>', 'Hahaha. Very cute. It may be me, but I think the focus is mid head and the face is a bit soft.', '2015-05-13 15:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350322, 1149648, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like how they are looking in different directions, as though one is looking into the past, and the other is staring down the present</td>', 'Lovely. I like how they are looking in different directions, as though one is looking into the past, and the other is staring down the present', '2015-05-13 15:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350323, 1149748, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, and nice moment of contemplation. I''m not sure about the crop...</td>', 'Lovely light, and nice moment of contemplation. I''m not sure about the crop...', '2015-05-13 15:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350324, 1149585, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and disturbing. His eyebrows remind me of my dad, whose own were similarly wiry and unwieldy.</td>', 'Wonderful and disturbing. His eyebrows remind me of my dad, whose own were similarly wiry and unwieldy.', '2015-05-13 15:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350325, 1149636, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful environmental portrait. I hope you are not getting dinged by the literalists seeking only head and shoulders....</td>', 'A wonderful environmental portrait. I hope you are not getting dinged by the literalists seeking only head and shoulders....', '2015-05-13 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350326, 1149755, 96751, '<td valign="top">Charming</td>', 'Charming', '2015-05-13 16:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350334, 1149735, 180331, '<td valign="top">Dont like lined up portraits. My favorite ! 10</td>', 'Dont like lined up portraits. My favorite ! 10', '2015-05-13 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350343, 1149453, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, handsome. Nice light. I''d have cropped just a bit up to his shoulder - not liking how his chest looks</td>', 'Very sweet, handsome. Nice light. I''d have cropped just a bit up to his shoulder - not liking how his chest looks', '2015-05-13 18:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350344, 1149724, 96751, '<td valign="top">You look like Tim McGraw!  Loving the crop, the blur, the grain. One of the more interesting entries</td>', 'You look like Tim McGraw!  Loving the crop, the blur, the grain. One of the more interesting entries', '2015-05-13 18:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350345, 1149515, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm, this has all the makings of a 40s studio portrait, but it''s too bright for me. Maybe just the bg needs to be darker. I''m not sure. also, the eyes are just a tad too sharp with all the soft airbrushing elsewhere...</td>', 'Hmmmmm, this has all the makings of a 40s studio portrait, but it''s too bright for me. Maybe just the bg needs to be darker. I''m not sure. also, the eyes are just a tad too sharp with all the soft airbrushing elsewhere...', '2015-05-13 18:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350346, 1149696, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome makeup! Digging the eyelashes, too :)</td>', 'Awesome makeup! Digging the eyelashes, too :)', '2015-05-13 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350347, 1149490, 96751, '<td valign="top">Definitely doesn''t look happy to be there....</td>', 'Definitely doesn''t look happy to be there....', '2015-05-13 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350348, 1149500, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like your out of the box thinking. I wish more attention had been paid to the lighting, though. The subject has potential but this is just way to flat</td>', 'I like your out of the box thinking. I wish more attention had been paid to the lighting, though. The subject has potential but this is just way to flat', '2015-05-13 18:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350349, 1149584, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha! Cool movie. I like this, although the applied paint detracts because of its uneveness. There is also an odd blue cast to her skin.</td>', 'Ha! Cool movie. I like this, although the applied paint detracts because of its uneveness. There is also an odd blue cast to her skin.', '2015-05-13 18:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350350, 1149717, 96751, '<td valign="top">Totally digging that beard!!!!</td>', 'Totally digging that beard!!!!', '2015-05-13 18:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350351, 1149524, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I love the simplicity. A curtain of self behind which to be real</td>', 'Nice!  I love the simplicity. A curtain of self behind which to be real', '2015-05-13 18:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350352, 1149573, 96751, '<td valign="top">That looks messy. I''m very intrigued by this image. A real story going on, and not just a head and shoulders. I wonder why he''s hiding behind the curtain. I wonder if that''s an artist''s studio. I wonder...</td>', 'That looks messy. I''m very intrigued by this image. A real story going on, and not just a head and shoulders. I wonder why he''s hiding behind the curtain. I wonder if that''s an artist''s studio. I wonder...', '2015-05-13 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350353, 1149705, 96751, '<td valign="top">The high key simply doesn''t work for me here</td>', 'The high key simply doesn''t work for me here', '2015-05-13 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350354, 1149572, 96751, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. I don''t know how you did this, but I''m needing to know. This is going to win the challenge. No doubt. Well, at least I think so :)</td>', 'Brilliant. I don''t know how you did this, but I''m needing to know. This is going to win the challenge. No doubt. Well, at least I think so :)', '2015-05-13 18:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350355, 1149595, 96751, '<td valign="top">Moody. Bizarre. Quirky. Awesome light.</td>', 'Moody. Bizarre. Quirky. Awesome light.', '2015-05-13 18:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350356, 1149731, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like a lovely memory</td>', 'Like a lovely memory', '2015-05-13 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350357, 1149758, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah, make me puke with that spin....</td>', 'Yeah, make me puke with that spin....', '2015-05-13 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350358, 1149769, 96751, '<td valign="top">This would totally have rocked in b/w.</td>', 'This would totally have rocked in b/w.', '2015-05-13 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7350359, 1149733, 96751, '<td valign="top">She made me cry</td>', 'She made me cry', '2015-05-13 18:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
