(7351974, 1149770, 113016, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> This was in my top four -- I am surprised to see this in 24th. Looks like a theme in the comments is some didn''t like the processing, but I beg to differ. It is unconventional but it drew me in. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thankyou Mark! That''s worth more than votes. :o)<br/>It''s almost exactly as I hoped.  It got a bit funky on output from LR as 16bit to DPC format...which I wish I could figure out...any tips on that I''m always anxious to learn.  LOL.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: This was in my top four -- I am surprised to see this in 24th. Looks like a theme in the comments is some didn''t like the processing, but I beg to differ. It is unconventional but it drew me in.   Thankyou Mark! That''s worth more than votes. :o)It''s almost exactly as I hoped.  It got a bit funky on output from LR as 16bit to DPC format...which I wish I could figure out...any tips on that I''m always anxious to learn.  LOL.', '2015-05-20 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
